hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18102","Yazid ibn Harun narrated to us, Muhammad ibn Amr informed us, from Saad ibn al-Mundhir ibn Abi Humayd al-Saidi, from Hamzah ibn Abi Usayd who said: I heard al-Harith ibn Ziyad, the Companion of the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, say: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: Whoever loves the Ansar, Allah will love him when He meets him, and whoever hates the Ansar, Allah will hate him when He meets him."
